{"assets":["/statement-assets/1cb82325b47e39f3d4ce5a3a06d6d1d52884a8345a0e13ca0155558b00eb2a53.png","/statement-assets/43e369a39e9f98901a74180c78c00816d484b98dc5b8726230558138e19c146a.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"922","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Birds"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Apart from plush toys, Imp is a huge fan of little yellow birds!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/1cb82325b47e39f3d4ce5a3a06d6d1d52884a8345a0e13ca0155558b00eb2a53.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To summon birds, Imp needs strong magic. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" trees in a row on an alley in a park, there is a nest on each of the trees. In the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th nest there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" birds; to summon one bird from this nest Imp needs to stay under this tree and it costs him "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"costi"},{"kind":"text","text":" points of mana. However, for each bird summoned, Imp increases his mana capacity by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":" points. Imp summons birds one by one, he can summon any number from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" birds from the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th nest. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially Imp stands under the first tree and has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" points of mana, and his mana capacity equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" as well. He can only go forward, and each time he moves from a tree to the next one, he restores "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":" points of mana (but it can't exceed his current mana capacity). Moving only forward, what is the maximum number of birds Imp can summon?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains four integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 103, 0 ≤ W, B, X ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of trees, the initial points of mana, the number of points the mana capacity increases after a bird is summoned, and the number of points restored when Imp moves from a tree to the next one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1, c2, ..., cn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ ci ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":") — where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of birds living in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th nest. It is guaranteed that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/43e369a39e9f98901a74180c78c00816d484b98dc5b8726230558138e19c146a.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cost1, cost2, ..., costn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ costi ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"costi"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the mana cost to summon a bird from the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th nest."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the maximum number of birds Imp can summon."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 12 0 4\n3 4\n4 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 1000 10 35\n1 2 4 5\n1000 500 250 200\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 10 7 11\n2 10\n6 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"11\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample base amount of Imp's mana is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"12"},{"kind":"text","text":" (with maximum capacity also equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"12"},{"kind":"text","text":"). After he summons two birds from the first nest, he loses "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"8"},{"kind":"text","text":" mana points, although his maximum capacity will not increase (since "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":"). After this step his mana will be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"12"},{"kind":"text","text":"; during the move you will replenish "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" mana points, and hence own "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"8"},{"kind":"text","text":" mana out of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"12"},{"kind":"text","text":" possible. Now it's optimal to take "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" birds from the second nest and spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"8"},{"kind":"text","text":" mana. The final answer will be — "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample the base amount of mana is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000"},{"kind":"text","text":". The right choice will be to simply pick all birds from the last nest. Note that Imp's mana doesn't restore while moving because it's initially full."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"922E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/922/problem/E"}